### 仅虚构示例；自行填写内存 Token 和自己可见的 ID
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@org = 1
@document = 1
@job = 1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 提交（没有 JSON body）
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/knowledge/documents/{{document}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 文档最近20个任务
GET {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/knowledge/documents/{{document}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 任务状态
GET {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/jobs/{{job}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 仅 FAILED/CANCELED，由创建者或admin重试
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/jobs/{{job}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 取消活动任务
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/jobs/{{job}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
